+# Verifier source review
+
+Reviewer: native agent `01a10f2c-a9c6-7790-9144-1c185be2a0f6` (Heisenberg), requested inherited model and high reasoning. Served model/effort metadata was not exposed.
+
+Final verdict: **Ship the verifier.** Read-only source review; no reviewer file writes or browser execution.
+
+The review drove successful late-byte delivery, full reduced/poster CAD-fetch checks at both widths, completed-frame observations, distinct frame counts, refreshed scroll-state restoration checks, exact intercepted-request error exemptions, per-case setup failure reporting, and synchronous Replay reset capture.
+
+The reviewer accepted the final corrections, including fatal-report handling and `verifierSha256` receipts. Browser evidence comes from the two producer runs, not this source review.
+
+V6 remains reserved for the parent rerun and different-provider review. This inherited-model source review does not satisfy V6.
+
+Stale completion coverage holds successfully received bytes before delivery to the runtime. Cancellation while `GLTFLoader.parseAsync` is pending remains outside this proof.
